/T (Rennes Rennes, the capital of Brittany, is a lively city known for its rich history, vibrant cultural scene, and thriving student population. As one of Brittany's most dynamic urban centers, it combines the charm of its historic medieval core with the convenience of modern amenities. The city is renowned for its half-timbered houses, impressive Rennes Cathedral, and the Parliament of Brittany, reflecting its deep historical roots.)
