391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Landscape and natural features Brittany, located in northwestern France, is a region renowned for its diverse and striking landscapes. The terrain varies from rugged coastal cliffs to rolling hills and fertile plains. The central part of the region is characterised by a mix of granite outcrops and rolling farmland, providing a rich backdrop of natural beauty. Brittany's landscape is shaped by its proximity to the Atlantic Ocean, creating dramatic coastal scenery and fertile inland areas.)
/E (Landscape and natural features Brittany, located in northwestern France, is a region renowned for its diverse and striking landscapes. The terrain varies from rugged coastal cliffs to rolling hills and fertile plains. The central part of the region is characterised by a mix of granite outcrops and rolling farmland, providing a rich backdrop of natural beauty. Brittany's landscape is shaped by its proximity to the Atlantic Ocean, creating dramatic coastal scenery and fertile inland areas.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Coastline and beaches Brittany boasts an extensive and varied coastline stretching over 2,700 kilometres \(1,700 miles\). The coastline is dotted with dramatic cliffs, rocky promontories, and sheltered coves. The region is home to some of France's most picturesque beaches, including the sandy expanses of La Baule and the rugged beauty of the Pink Granite Coast. The coastline offers ample opportunities for maritime activities such as sailing, surfing, and fishing, with numerous scenic spots for relaxation and exploration.)
/E (Coastline and beaches Brittany boasts an extensive and varied coastline stretching over 2,700 kilometres \(1,700 miles\). The coastline is dotted with dramatic cliffs, rocky promontories, and sheltered coves. The region is home to some of France's most picturesque beaches, including the sandy expanses of La Baule and the rugged beauty of the Pink Granite Coast. The coastline offers ample opportunities for maritime activities such as sailing, surfing, and fishing, with numerous scenic spots for relaxation and exploration.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
